    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……どうだ、夏葉\r\n少しは心の整理ができたか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6013001070010,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……ありがとう、プロデューサー\r\nやっぱり、さっきの強がりは見抜かれていたのね",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601300107/6013001070010"
  },
  {
    "id": 6013001070020,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……『W.I.N.G.』が終わった後、私\r\nとても大切なことに気づいたの",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601300107/6013001070020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6013001070030,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ステージが終わった後にね、ファンの人たちが\r\nいっぱい声をかけてきてくれて……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601300107/6013001070030"
  },
  {
    "id": 6013001070040,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私はこんなにも\r\n支えられていたんだって教えられたわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601300107/6013001070040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……！",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6013001070050,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……ファンの存在って偉大よね\r\n負けた私にも、声援を送ってくれる",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601300107/6013001070050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6013001070060,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "アイドルって人に元気を与える仕事だと思ってたけど、\r\n逆に勇気をもらうことのほうが多いのかもしれないわ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601300107/6013001070060"
  },
  {
    "id": 6013001070070,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "だから大丈夫よ、プロデューサー\r\n支えてくれるファンがいる限り、私は絶対に諦めないから",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601300107/6013001070070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだな！　ファンのためにも\r\nもっともっと魅力的なアイドルを目指していこう！",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6013001070080,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "もちろん、私の一番のファンはプロデューサーでしょう？\r\nこれからもいろいろあると思うけど、よろしく頼むわね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601300107/6013001070080"
  },
